[h1]R.A.T.S. Clean Screen[/h1]
[i]R.A.T.S. – Reconnaissance, Acoustics, Terrain & Signals[/i]

[b]Your windows, no version label on top.[/b]
Switches off the game's version label ("Sea Power v0.9.1-...") that sits on top of windows, the map and other mods' windows.

[quote]▶ [b]No mod loader needed:[/b] two ini lines, no code
✉ Bugs, ideas, questions: [url=https://hub.sewerlabs.dev/s/cleanscreen]R.A.T.S. feedback board[/url]
⭐ A favourite helps other captains find it[/quote]

[h2]✦ Highlights[/h2]
[list]
[*][b]The label is gone[/b] from title bars, the map and popped-out windows
[*][b]No code:[/b] a config patch that sets [b]ShowVersionWatermark=False[/b] in the game's own config
[*][b]Off again in a click:[/b] switch the mod off in Mods and the label is back
[/list]

[h2]▶ Quick start[/h2]
[olist]
[*]Subscribe
[*]Switch R.A.T.S. Clean Screen on in Mods
[*]Restart the game
[/olist]

[h2]⚠ Good to know[/h2]
[list]
[*][b]Changes nothing else[/b] in the game, missions or saves
[/list]

[h2]⚙ Install and game versions[/h2]
[list]
[*][b]Run in the game on 0.9.1[/b] (build 261112): Red Sea Breakout shows no label
[*][b]0.8.7:[/b] not run
[/list]

[h2]✉ Problems, feedback, ideas[/h2]
